WEBVTT - typo3-webmcp (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.538
Browser agents now shop and book. Most sites give them nothing to hold.

2
00:00:12.238 --> 00:00:16.065
You ask for search and contact as browser tools.

3
00:00:18.738 --> 00:00:25.804
Chrome now sees four tools: navigation, FAQ search, language and a form helper.

4
00:00:27.154 --> 00:00:33.619
An agent fills the form. The consent box stays empty; a person sends it.

5
00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:38.731
A schema is not consent. People stay in charge.

6
00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:43.322
Open source. Clone the skills.
